# Pipeline

This repository contains a cross-platform, extensible pipeline for building, testing and deploying projects. It is intentionally small and easily integrated into existing repositories or CI providers.

## Contents
- scripts/        - portable scripts to run pipeline stages (build/test/package/deploy)
- pipeline/       - pipeline stage implementations and helpers
- config/         - default configuration and environment templates
- tests/          - test harness and test suites

## Goals
- Provide a minimal, repeatable pipeline that runs locally or in CI
- Keep stage logic platform-agnostic (works on POSIX and Windows)
- Make it easy to extend and hook into CI providers (GitHub Actions, Azure Pipelines, GitLab CI, etc.)

## Quick start
Prerequisites:
- Git
- A shell (bash, PowerShell) or a container runtime (Docker)

